      "description": "Same five destinations; preview stays in normal flow.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><button class=\"ds-tab\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ds-navicon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 10 9-7 9 7v10H3z\"/><path d=\"M9 20v-6h6v6\"/></svg></span>Today</button><button class=\"ds-tab\"><span class=\"ds-navicon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M7 3v4m10-4v4M3 10h18\"/></svg></span>Routine</button><button class=\"ds-tab\"><span class=\"ds-navicon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V3M7 3v18M19 3c-3 3-4 7-4 10h4m0-10v18\"/></svg></span>Food</button><button class=\"ds-tab\"><span class=\"ds-navicon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"m7 21 4-7 3 3 1 4M4 13l4-4 4 1 3 4 4-1M12 10l-1 4\"/></svg></span>Move</button><button class=\"ds-tab\"><span class=\"ds-navicon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 20V4m0 16h17M9 16v-5m5 5V7m5 9V4\"/></svg></span>Insights</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:2px;padding:9px 8px 10px;background:var(--surface,#fff);border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e0e6db)}.ds-tab{border:0;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;transition:background-color .18s,color .18s;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:650;color:var(--muted,#5c6c62);background:none;min-height:54px}.ds-tab[aria-current=page]{color:var(--green,#245a46);font-weight:800}.ds-navicon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:30px;border-radius:12px}.ds-tab[aria-current=page] .ds-navicon{background:#dff0d4;color:#245a46}.ds-nav svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}.ds-tab:hover{filter:brightness(.97)}.ds-tab:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #769d40;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-tab:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-tab{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Informational pill",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "pill",
      "description": "Noninteractive schedule context.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-pill\">Weekday plan</span>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;display:inline-block;background:#e9f2dd;color:#245a46;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:750}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Content panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Flat bordered content group.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>Sleep & recovery</h2><p>Last night\u2019s sleep \u00b7 goal 8 hrs</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#152b25);border:1px solid var(--line,#e0e6db);border-radius:23px;padding:17px;margin-bottom:12px;box-shadow:none}.ds-panel h2{margin:0;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-panel p{margin:10px 0 0;color:var(--muted,#5c6c62);font-size:13px}@media(min-width:800px){.ds-panel{padding:21px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Hydration metric",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "metric-water",
      "description": "Whole-card action representing the four health categories.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-metric\"><span class=\"ds-ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3c-3 5-7 9-7 13a7 7 0 0 0 14 0c0-4-4-8-7-13Z\"/><path d=\"M8 16c0 2 1 3 3 3\"/></svg></span><small>Hydration</small><strong>1.0 L</strong><span class=\"ds-mini\">of 2 L goal</span><span class=\"ds-track\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Goal progress\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"><span></span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-metric{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;border:0;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;transition:background-color .18s,color .18s;border-radius:21px;padding:15px;min-height:155px;min-width:150px;background:var(--blue,#dfedfa);color:#173129;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;transition:transform .3s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-ico{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:12px;background:#ffffff85;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:12px}.ds-ico svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}.ds-metric small{font-size:12px;color:#40584e}.ds-metric strong{font-size:25px;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ds-mini{font-size:12px;margin:3px 0 9px}.ds-track{margin-top:auto;width:100%;background:#17312916;height:6px;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden}.ds-track span{height:100%;display:block;width:50%;border-radius:20px;background:#3b7659}.ds-metric:hover{filter:brightness(.97);transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-metric:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-metric:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #769d40;outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-metric{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Completed check",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "completion-done",
      "description": "Pressed circular completion control.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-check\" aria-label=\"Undo walk break\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-check{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;border:0;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;transition:background-color .18s,color .18s;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #245a46;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#245a46;color:#fff;transition:background-color .25s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)),color .25s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-check svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;animation:ds-check-in .35s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}@keyframes ds-check-in{from{transform:scale(.5)}to{transform:scale(1)}}.ds-check:hover{filter:brightness(.97)}.ds-check:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-check:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #769d40;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-check:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-check{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-check svg{animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Daily completion hero",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "hero",
      "description": "Summary with equivalent text and circular progress.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-hero\"><div><h2>Make time<br>for yourself.</h2><p>6 of 13 routines completed</p></div><div class=\"ds-ring\"><div><b>46%</b><small>completed</small></div></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-hero{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;background:#204e3c;color:#f8fff0;border-radius:27px;padding:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;overflow:hidden}.ds-hero h2{font-size:25px;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:9px 0}.ds-hero p{font-size:12px;color:#d6e6d5;max-width:170px;margin:0}.ds-ring{width:112px;height:112px;flex:0 0 112px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(#dff6aa 46%,#ffffff25 0);display:grid;place-items:center}.ds-ring>div{background:#204e3c;border-radius:50%;width:91px;height:91px;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center}.ds-ring b{font-size:30px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ds-ring small{color:#d6e6d5;font-size:10px}@media(max-width:360px){.ds-hero{padding:16px}.ds-ring{width:95px;height:95px;flex-basis:95px}.ds-ring>div{width:78px;height:78px}}@media(min-width:800px){.ds-hero{padding:28px}.ds-hero h2{font-size:30px}.ds-hero p{max-width:300px;font-size:14px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Everyday health",
    "overview": "DevWell extends the supplied mobile prototype into a practical personal wellness companion. Its forest and sage identity, pastel health categories, authored leaf mark and five-tab navigation are the visual authority. \u201cEveryday health\u201d is the incumbent app title, used here as a descriptive anchor rather than a newly selected metaphor.\n\nCompact rounded containers, clear numerical progress and familiar system typography make everyday logging approachable. Desktop adds useful space while keeping the mobile language. This records the implemented system, not a separately approved visual redesign or newly inferred user preferences.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Forest identity and pastel health categories.",
      "Mobile-first navigation with an expanded desktop container.",
      "Legible system type, keyboard focus and restrained motion.",
      "Flat panels with limited floating elevation."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Flat Panel Rule",
        "body": "Keep content panels flat; use the existing border and tonal surface to separate them.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the authored leaf and forest/sage/pastel identity.",
      "**Do** retain Today, Routine, Food, Move and Insights on every screen width.",
      "**Do** pair graphical progress and selection with text or semantic state.",
      "**Do** preserve visible focus, touch targets and reduced-motion support.",
      "**Do** use the established category colors consistently."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** replace the incumbent identity with an unrelated visual world.",
      "**Don't** restore the disabled decorative hero rings as a default pattern.",
      "**Don't** reinstate the removed Daily routine hero kicker as a system requirement.",
      "**Don't** assume all forest and pastel components recolor with the dark theme.",
      "**Don't** add cloud or account status patterns without new product scope."
    ]
  }
}
